{"code":"014570","name":"고려제약","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"제약","sector_desc":"의약품을 개발·생산·판매. 신약 파이프라인과 임상 결과, 약가 정책에 주가가 크게 반응합니다.","desc":"동사는 1980년 설립되어 의약품 제조 및 판매업을 영위하며, 2000년 코스닥시장에 상장하였음. 대표 감기약 '하벤' 등 일반의약품과 중추신경계(CNS) 질환 등 전문의약품을 생산·판매하며, 종합감기약, 조혈영양제, 소화기계용제, 항생항균제 등 다양한 제품군을 보유하고 있음. 약국·병원·의원사업부를 통해 국내외 판매하고, 7개 연구팀에서 신약·제네릭·건강기능식품 개발에 주력하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-23","n_days":300,"close":3080.0,"open":3030.0,"high":3085.0,"low":2940.0,"volume":9928,"amount":30578240.0,"ret_1d":1.6502,"gap":0.0,"range_pct":4.7078,"ret_5":1.1494,"ret_20":-9.8097,"ret_60":-8.4695,"ret_120":-26.5793,"ret_250":-28.6211,"ma20":3194.5,"ma60":3350.5833,"ma120":3440.5417,"ma200":3694.6,"close_vs_ma200":-16.6351,"close_vs_ma60":-8.0757,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":-32.1484,"r2_60":0.4152,"slope_120":-27.1887,"r2_120":0.4035,"slope_250":-29.495,"r2_250":0.828,"high52":4550.0,"low52":2865.0,"pos_52w":12.7596,"dd_52w":-32.3077,"mdd_1y":-32.514,"atr14_pct":6.737,"vol_ann_60":26.4997,"vol_avg20":7783.7,"vol_ratio20":1.2755,"vr5":0.9239,"vr20":0.5919,"amount_avg5":17172994.0,"amount_avg20":25003799.0,"amount_avg60":20211069.75,"obv_chg20":-29.4468,"turnover_20":1.4152,"pv_eff_20":-6.9316,"rsi14":39.5314,"frgn_net_5":1942.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.0177,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":0.0177,"frgn_net_20":-576.0,"inst_net_20":8365.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":-0.0052,"inst_net_20_pct":0.076,"smart_net_20_pct":0.0708,"frgn_net_60":12246.0,"inst_net_60":28722.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":0.1113,"inst_net_60_pct":0.2611,"smart_net_60_pct":0.3724,"frgn_net_120":-25165.0,"inst_net_120":100048.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":-0.2288,"inst_net_120_pct":0.9095,"smart_net_120_pct":0.6808,"foreign_ratio":2.88,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":0.21,"smart_buy_streak":1,"op_income_q":27.0,"op_margin_q":15.3409,"op_qoq":125.0,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":22.7273,"rev_yoy":18.1208,"op_trend_4q":7.1795,"fin_period":"202606","roe":1.88,"debt_ratio":25.48,"per":22.81,"pbr":0.42,"div_yield":5.84,"foreig